f"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those 75 years. On the middle, April to May came in at 47% of normal in 2025, and February to March sits at 12% in 2026 so far. Grid 23521 had its driest year in 2002 at 44% of normal.</p>"}
